L9_1 = "CHANGELOG\n==========================================\nUPDATE 5\n\nImprovements\n\n\226\151\143 Released for FM 26.3.0.\n\nFixed\n\n\226\151\143 Reactivated Golden Generation.\n\226\151\143 Fixed an issue where Extra Staff displayed incorrect values.\n\nUPDATE 4\n\nImprovements\n\n\226\151\143 Released for FM 26.2.0.\n\226\151\143 Renamed preset \226\128\156Board Always Accepts Your Requests (Including Club Vision)\226\128\157 \226\134\146 \226\128\156Force Board to Accept Your Requests (Including Club Vision)\226\128\157.\n\226\151\143 Renamed preset \226\128\156Players and Staff Always Accept Your Contract Offers\226\128\157 \226\134\146 \226\128\156Force Players and Staff to Accept Your Contract Offers\226\128\157.\n\226\151\143 Renamed preset \226\128\156Recruit Players for Any Fee\226\128\157 \226\134\146 \226\128\156Force Other Clubs to Accept Your Transfer Offers\226\128\157.\n\nFixed\n\n\226\151\143 Reactivated Force Other Clubs to Accept Your Transfer Offers.\n\nUPDATE 3\n\nImprovements\n\n\226\151\143 Released for game version 26.1.3.\n\nFixed\n\n\226\151\143 Fixed an issue where object names were not displayed properly.\n\226\151\143 Reactivated On-Match Player Ability Modifier.\n\nUPDATE 2\n\nImprovements\n\n\226\151\143 Released for game version 26.1.2.\n\n\nUPDATE 1\n\nImprovements\n\n\226\151\143 Updated the notes for Global Presets.\n\nFixed\n\n\226\151\143 Reactivated Accelerate Player Development.\n\226\151\143 Reactivated Board Always Accepts Your Requests (Including Club Vision).\n\226\151\143 Reactivated Players and Staff Always Accept Your Contract Offers.\n\226\151\143 Reactivated No Work Permits.\n\226\151\143 Reactivated No Transfer Windows.\n\226\151\143 Reactivated No Loan Restrictions.\n\n\nINITIAL RELEASE\n\nImprovements\n\n\226\151\143 Released for game version 26.1.1.\n"
_ENV[L8_1] = L9_1
L8_1 = "tableReadme"
L9_1 = string
L9_1 = L9_1.format
L10_1 = "%s CHEAT TABLE\n========================================================================\nThis table was a collaboration between me (tdg6661) and tfigment.\n\nSupported Platforms: Epic Games, PC Game Pass, and Steam\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO USE SEARCH FEATURE\n========================================================================\n1. Ensure that Main Script is selected and successfully loaded (no errors).\n2. Make sure Update Global Pointers (Table Settings -> Update Global Pointers) is selected and loaded successfully (no errors).\n3. Type something in the search box, choose an object type, then click on \"Search.\"\n4. The discovered items will be added to Search ->.\n5. To select an item, open the item name and click Set Focus to xxxxxx.\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO USE FREEZER FEATURE\n========================================================================\nThis feature is currently only available for clubs and nations.\n\n1. Ensure that Main Script is selected and successfully loaded (with no errors).\n2. Go to the desired club or nation, open Presets, and then click Add to Freezer.\n3. Open Freezer, turn on freezer first.\n4. Select an item you added, turn on Switcher, and then choose any option available.\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO USE ADVANCED FEATURES\n========================================================================\nThis setting will enable database listing and add a changeable pointer.\n\n1. Ensure that Main Script is selected and successfully loaded (no errors).\n2. Make sure Update Global Pointers (Table Settings -> Update Global Pointers) is selected and loaded successfully (no errors).\n3. Make sure you're loaded or start a game first, or this feature will not work well.\n4. Go to Table Settings and activate the Use Advanced Features script.\n5. Data will be loaded in 10\226\128\14740 seconds (depending on your CPU) and will consume more RAM. So, don't panic if the table gets frozen for a while.\n6. Go to a pointer value type (marked as blue), and press Space to open the Selection List window.\n7. From the Selection List, select an item and then click OK.\194\160\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO USE DISSECT DATA\n========================================================================\n1. Open Memory View -> Tools -> Dissect data/structures (CTRL+D).\n2. Click File -> Import.\n3. Open structures folder, choose DisectDataStructures.CSX, click OK.\n4. Now open desire item (Club / Nation / Person / etc..).\n5. Open Presets -> Open in Dissect Data.\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO CHANGE DATE\n========================================================================\nTip: The date 01/01/1900 or 1900 means \"not set\" (invalid) date / year in FM.\n\n1. Select FM Date data type value (e.g., 21/12/2021).\n2. Put [X] or simply press Space, and a window will appear.\n3. Change the date, month, and year, then click OK.\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO CHANGE TABLE LANGUAGE\n========================================================================\n1. Go to Table Settings > More Settings.\n2. Look for Table.Language, then change value from available options.\n3. Click OK; activate More Settings.\n\nINSTRUCTION - HOW TO CHANGE TABLE CURRENCY\n========================================================================\n1. Go to Table Settings > More Settings.\n2. Look for Table.CurrencyType, then change value from available options.\n3. Click OK; activate More Settings.\n4. Note: This setting will not be applied to dynamic lists.\n\nSPECIAL THANKS TO\n========================================================================\n\226\151\143 Dark Byte\n\226\151\143 tfigment\n\226\151\143 TheyCallMeTim13\n\226\151\143 mece\n\226\151\143 EpicBirdi\n\226\151\143 aSwedishMagyar\n\226\151\143 All FM trainer creators\194\160\n\226\151\143 All Donators and Patrons\n\nSUPPORT & DONATION\n========================================================================\nIf you like this table and would like to support me, you can buy me some coffee by donating. So I can spare more time and motivation into this, although I can't offer too much aside from table and features request as I want to keep this table free of charge.\n\nWorld Wide:\n\226\151\143 Patreon - %s\n\226\151\143 PayPal - %s\n\nIndonesia:\n\226\151\143 KaryaKarsa - %s\n"
